# Only the @ssw scope resolves from the Azure Artifacts feed; everything else
# keeps coming from npmjs.com, so `npm ci` needs no credentials in CI.
#
# Credentials are personal and live in the user-level ~/.npmrc. Generate them with:
#   npx vsts-npm-auth -config .npmrc
@ssw:registry=https://pkgs.dev.azure.com/stream-software/_packaging/ssw-design-system/npm/registry/
